Third-party code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Manage menu and the features behind it — Manage Tunnels, Status, Health
Check, Exit Health, Tunnel Metrics, Restart All, Auto Refresh, the Built-in
SOCKS5/HTTP Proxy and File Locations — are taken from BackPack (AGPL-3.0),
adapted to C-Tunnel. BackPack's IP Spoofing Tester is not included.
The ported files say so at the top: pkg/cli/manage.go, pkg/cli/health.go,
pkg/socks, pkg/localproxy, pkg/schedule and pkg/netscore.

BackPack's NOTICE requires this line to stay visible and unaltered:

  Based on BackPack by Amin Mohammadi (AminMGMT)
  https://github.com/AminMGMT/BackPack

"BackPack" is a mark of Amin Mohammadi (AminMGMT); C-Tunnel is a separate
project with its own name and is not BackPack.
